00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,135
that's basically nothing.

23
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:55,151
Going through that inner loop is pretty

24
00:00:55,215 --> 00:00:58,067
redundant, and we're not doing any actual

25
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:00,295
work in there. We're storing a value in our

26
00:01:00,407 --> 00:01:02,794
helper variable, but we never make it into

