00:01:19,811 --> 00:01:20,179
like this.

36
00:01:21,111 --> 00:01:23,489
So we basically have no work to do. That's

37
00:01:23,489 --> 00:01:25,208
why we can say that we have linear time

38
00:01:25,273 --> 00:01:27,522
complexity here. We need to go through the

