00:02:39,983 --> 00:02:42,488
like that, you have quadratic time. It's a

72
00:02:42,488 --> 00:02:45,613
simple rule of thumb: 1 loop, linear time; 2

73
00:02:45,742 --> 00:02:48,947
loops, quadratic time; 3 nested loops, cubic

74
00:02:48,963 --> 00:02:51,832
time; and so on. That's basically how you

75
00:02:51,832 --> 00:02:53,739
